  "office_hours": "Parish Office: Weekdays 09:00–18:00; Saturday 09:00–12:00 and 17:00–18:00; Sunday 08:00–12:00 and 17:00–18:00; closed on Public Holidays.",
  "good_to_know": [
   "All Saints Day (1 Nov) is a Holy Day of Obligation. The 11am Mass is a Family Mass; children from Catechetical Year 1 & 2 and CGS will be dressed as their favourite saint and will be part of the entrance procession.",
   "All Souls Day (2 Nov) Masses are at 07:00 and 18:00. You are invited to write the names of your dearly departed on slips of post-its and paste them on the wooden cross on the left of the sanctuary to be offered up at the All Souls Day Masse",
   "59 youths and adults will receive the Sacrament of Confirmation on Saturday, 7 Nov at the 18:00 Mass."
